      "content": "<div class=\"wt-text-body-01\"><p class=\"wt-pt-xs-2 wt-pb-xs-2\">Etsy's Open API provides a simple RESTful interface for various Etsy.com features.</p><p class=\"wt-pb-xs-2\">If you'd like to report an issue or provide feedback on the API design, <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"wt-text-link wt-p-xs-0\" href=\"https://github.com/etsy/open-api/discussions\">please add an issue in Github</a>.</p></div>&copy; 2021-2026 Etsy, Inc. All Rights Reserved. Use of this code is subject to Etsy's <a class='wt-text-link wt-p-xs-0' target='_blank' href='https://www.etsy.com/legal/api'>API Developer Terms of Use</a>.\n\nContact Support:\n Email: developers@etsy.com",
